      "comment": "Andersdotter: Goddess of Fate",
      "content": "In Simulanka's lore M is the Goddess of Fate, one of three goddesses who made the world. A statue of her exists there, distinct from the goddess statue in the Metropole. Her journal and letter, read during the limited event Summertide Scales and Tales, show her fondness for Simulanka's people and her wish that they might carve their own destinies.",
