      "content": "A seven-volume relay story written by Hexenzirkel members: Alice, Barbeloth, Rhinedottir, I. Ivanovna N., Nicole, Octavia and, partly, Andersdotter. Durin's Character Story 5 says Anya was assigned the final chapter but died before her turn, and volume 5 ended abruptly in a single line. Alice later wrote the ending.",
